# Files that live in the repo but must not be on the web.
#
# This exists because of what linking the repo to Netlify would change. Today the
# site is uploaded by hand, and whoever does it drags the shipping files — so the
# notes, the archive and the Apps Script source have never been reachable
# (checked: every path below answered 404 on the live site). A git-linked deploy
# publishes the repo instead of a hand-picked folder, and every one of them would
# go up with it. Netlify has no ignore-list for the publish directory; a redirect
# to a 404 is the way you take a path off a site.
#
# changes.md and PORTFOLIO.md are the notes we keep for ourselves, Code.gs is the
# server half of the contact form, and the backups are older copies of pages that
# are still live — a stale index.html sitting at a guessable URL is the worst of
# the set. First match wins, so keep these above anything general.
#
# The trailing ! is not decoration and this file does nothing without it. A plain
# redirect rule is only consulted when the path matches NO file on the site, so a
# rule aimed at a file that exists is skipped every time — measured on a draft
# deploy: all six .md files answered 200 with the bare 404 rules. The bang forces
# the rule to win over the file.
#
# Serving a nonexistent target with a 404 status is deliberate: Netlify's own
# not-found page answers, and the path is indistinguishable from one that was
# never there.

# The ช้อปดี demo was renamed ถึงไว on 20/8/26 and its folder moved with it. Anyone
# holding the old link — it went out in PORTFOLIO.md — lands on the new one instead
# of a 404. Above the catch-all rules on purpose: first match wins.
# NOTE: no "!" on this line. The bang is Netlify's force flag; Cloudflare Pages —
# which is what actually serves this site — treats a rule it cannot parse as no
# rule at all, and the redirect silently did nothing (measured: 404 on the old
# URL after deploying with 301!). The rest of this file is Netlify-shaped and
# does nothing on Pages either; those paths are simply not in the dist.
# ร้านเดโมถูกเปลี่ยนชื่อสองรอบ: ช้อปดี → ถึงไว → PARCELA ทุกชื่อเก่าต้องพาไปที่
# ชื่อปัจจุบัน ไม่ใช่ชี้ต่อกันเป็นทอดๆ — วัดแล้ว: /work/shopdee/ เคย 301 ไปที่
# /work/tuengwai/ ซึ่งเป็นหน้าที่ไม่มีอยู่ในบิลด์นี้แล้ว คนกดลิงก์เก่าจึงไปจบที่ 404
# (และช่วงหนึ่งไปจบที่หน้าแบรนด์เก่าที่ค้างอยู่บนโปรดักชัน ซึ่งแย่กว่า 404)
/work/shopdee                   /work/parcela/          301
/work/shopdee/                  /work/parcela/          301
/work/shopdee/*                 /work/parcela/:splat    301
/work/tuengwai                  /work/parcela/          301
/work/tuengwai/                 /work/parcela/          301
/work/tuengwai/*                /work/parcela/:splat    301

/changes.md                     /404.html   404!
/PORTFOLIO.md                   /404.html   404!
/DESIGN-KITCHEN.md              /404.html   404!
/PROMPT-REBUILD.md              /404.html   404!
/website_building.md            /404.html   404!
/HERO-REEL-UPDATE-2026-08-18.md /404.html   404!

/index.backup-anim.html         /404.html   404!
/css/styles.backup-svc.css      /404.html   404!

/_archive/*                     /404.html   404!
/design/*                       /404.html   404!
/playbook/*                     /404.html   404!
/google-apps-script/*           /404.html   404!

